{"seq":2,"slug":"bandwidth-battery-optimization","title":"带宽与电量优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/bandwidth-battery-optimization","wordCount":1402,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"带宽与电量优化\">带宽与电量优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>移动同步消耗三种稀缺资源：带宽（蜂窝按量计费）、电量（无线电唤醒高成本）、CPU（序列化/压缩/加密）。核心优化手段包括：传输压缩（zstd/Protobuf）、增量同步、批量聚合（减少无线电唤醒次数）、智能调度（Piggyback + 平台约束 API）、自适应弱网策略（RTT 滑动窗口估算），以及数据传输量预算管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步是移动端的隐形资源消费者\">同步是移动端的隐形资源消费者</h2><p>网络同步涉及三种稀缺资源的消耗：<strong>带宽</strong>（蜂窝数据按量计费）、<strong>电量</strong>（无线电模块是耗电大户）、<strong>CPU</strong>（数据序列化/压缩/加密）。未经优化的同步实现可能让应用成为「电池杀手」和「流量黑洞」——用户会在不知道原因的情况下卸载应用。</p>\n<p>移动网络无线电的状态机模型揭示了为什么频繁小批次同步比低频大批次更耗电：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; IDLE&#10;    IDLE --&gt; CONNECTING : 数据请求&#10;    CONNECTING --&gt; ACTIVE : 连接建立(~2s, 高功耗)&#10;    ACTIVE --&gt; TAIL : 数据传输完成&#10;    TAIL --&gt; IDLE : 尾部定时器到期(~10-30s, 中功耗)&#10;    ACTIVE --&gt; ACTIVE : 持续传输(高功耗)&#10;    TAIL --&gt; ACTIVE : 新数据请求(无需重新连接)\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; IDLE\n    IDLE --&gt; CONNECTING : 数据请求\n    CONNECTING --&gt; ACTIVE : 连接建立(~2s, 高功耗)\n    ACTIVE --&gt; TAIL : 数据传输完成\n    TAIL --&gt; IDLE : 尾部定时器到期(~10-30s, 中功耗)\n    ACTIVE --&gt; ACTIVE : 持续传输(高功耗)\n    TAIL --&gt; ACTIVE : 新数据请求(无需重新连接)</pre><p>关键洞察：无线电从 IDLE 唤醒到 ACTIVE 的过程消耗大量电量（约 30-50mA），且传输结束后会维持 10-30 秒的 TAIL 状态（仍在耗电）。因此<strong>每次唤醒的固定成本很高</strong>——10 次 1KB 的传输比 1 次 10KB 的传输多消耗 5-10 倍电量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽优化策略\">带宽优化策略</h2><h3 id=\"传输压缩\">传输压缩</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压缩算法</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>压缩速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>gzip</td>\n<td>70-80%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>通用文本/JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brotli</td>\n<td>75-85%</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>静态资源预压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>zstd</td>\n<td>70-85%</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>实时同步数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Protocol Buffers</td>\n<td>50-70%（vs JSON）</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>结构化同步 payload</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同步 payload 的压缩效果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BandwidthSaving</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>CompressedSize</mtext><mtext>OriginalSize</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>CompressionRatio</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BandwidthSaving} = 1 - \\frac{\\text{CompressedSize}}{\\text{OriginalSize}} = 1 - \\frac{1}{\\text{CompressionRatio}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BandwidthSaving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OriginalSize</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CompressedSize</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CompressionRatio</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践数据：JSON 格式的同步 payload 经 zstd 压缩后体积减少 70-80%。对于蜂窝网络上的用户，这意味着同样的同步内容消耗的流量减少到原来的 1/4-1/3。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增量同步-vs-全量同步\">增量同步 vs 全量同步</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>带宽消耗</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>恢复能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量同步</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 与数据总量成正比</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>可从任意状态恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量同步（cursor）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 与变更量成正比</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>依赖 cursor 连续性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差分同步（binary diff）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>diff</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{diff})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">diff</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> — 最小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要基础版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>大多数场景推荐<strong>增量同步 + 定期全量校验</strong>——日常走增量省带宽，定期全量 checksum 防止增量积累的偏差。当 cursor 断裂（如服务端 GC 了旧变更）时回退到全量重同步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"选择性同步与数据分级\">选择性同步与数据分级</h3><p>不是所有数据都需要同等优先级同步：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"enum class SyncPriority {&#10;    CRITICAL,    // 用户主动操作产生的变更（立即同步）&#10;    HIGH,        // 核心业务数据（Wi-Fi 或 5G 时同步）&#10;    NORMAL,      // 辅助数据（Wi-Fi 时同步）&#10;    LOW          // 日志/分析（Wi-Fi + 充电时同步）&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun decideSyncBehavior(&#10;    priority: SyncPriority,&#10;    network: NetworkState,&#10;    battery: BatteryState&#10;): SyncDecision {&#10;    return when {&#10;        priority == SyncPriority.CRITICAL -&gt; SyncDecision.IMMEDIATE&#10;        network.isUnmetered &amp;&amp; battery.isCharging -&gt; SyncDecision.IMMEDIATE&#10;        network.isUnmetered -&gt; SyncDecision.BATCH_NORMAL&#10;        network.isMetered &amp;&amp; priority &lt;= SyncPriority.HIGH -&gt; SyncDecision.BATCH_SMALL&#10;        network.isMetered -&gt; SyncDecision.DEFER&#10;        else -&gt; SyncDecision.DEFER&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum class SyncPriority {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    CRITICAL,    // 用户主动操作产生的变更（立即同步）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    HIGH,        // 核心业务数据（Wi-Fi 或 5G 时同步）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NORMAL,      // 辅助数据（Wi-Fi 时同步）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    LOW          // 日志/分析（Wi-Fi + 充电时同步）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun decideSyncBehavior(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    priority: SyncPriority,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    network: NetworkState,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    battery: BatteryState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): SyncDecision {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        priority == SyncPriority.CRITICAL -> SyncDecision.IMMEDIATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        network.isUnmetered &#x26;&#x26; battery.isCharging -> SyncDecision.IMMEDIATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        network.isUnmetered -> SyncDecision.BATCH_NORMAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        network.isMetered &#x26;&#x26; priority &#x3C;= SyncPriority.HIGH -> SyncDecision.BATCH_SMALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        network.isMetered -> SyncDecision.DEFER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> SyncDecision.DEFER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"电量优化策略\">电量优化策略</h2><h3 id=\"批量聚合-batching\">批量聚合（Batching）</h3><p>将多次小写入聚合为一次批量推送，减少无线电唤醒次数：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;未优化&quot;&#10;        W1[写入 1] --&gt; P1[推送 1]&#10;        W2[写入 2] --&gt; P2[推送 2]&#10;        W3[写入 3] --&gt; P3[推送 3]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;批量优化&quot;&#10;        W4[写入 1] --&gt; BUF[缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;等待 5s 或 10 条]&#10;        W5[写入 2] --&gt; BUF&#10;        W6[写入 3] --&gt; BUF&#10;        BUF --&gt; P4[批量推送]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"未优化\"\n        W1[写入 1] --&gt; P1[推送 1]\n        W2[写入 2] --&gt; P2[推送 2]\n        W3[写入 3] --&gt; P3[推送 3]\n    end\n    subgraph \"批量优化\"\n        W4[写入 1] --&gt; BUF[缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;等待 5s 或 10 条]\n        W5[写入 2] --&gt; BUF\n        W6[写入 3] --&gt; BUF\n        BUF --&gt; P4[批量推送]\n    end</pre><p>批量策略参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间窗口</strong>：累积 3-10 秒内的变更合并为一批</li>\n<li><strong>数量阈值</strong>：达到 10-50 条变更时立即推送</li>\n<li><strong>体积上限</strong>：单批不超过 256KB（避免大 payload 在弱网下超时）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"智能调度-利用-piggyback-机会\">智能调度：利用 Piggyback 机会</h3><p>当设备已经因为其他原因唤醒无线电时（如推送通知到达、用户正在浏览网页），顺便执行同步操作——利用已有的 ACTIVE 窗口避免额外唤醒。</p>\n<p>iOS 的 <code>BGAppRefreshTask</code> 和 Android 的 <code>WorkManager</code> 的 maintenance window 天然提供了这种「搭便车」的机会。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台级电量优化-api\">平台级电量优化 API</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>优化能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td><code>BGProcessingTask</code></td>\n<td>系统选择最优时机执行后台任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td><code>URLSession.isDiscretionary</code></td>\n<td>系统延迟到 Wi-Fi + 充电时传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>WorkManager Constraints</td>\n<td>声明式约束（网络/充电/电量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td><code>ConnectivityManager.isActiveNetworkMetered</code></td>\n<td>判断是否计费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS：大文件同步标记为 discretionary&#10;let config = URLSessionConfiguration.background(&#10;    withIdentifier: &quot;com.app.sync&quot;&#10;)&#10;config.isDiscretionary = true  // 系统选择最优时机&#10;config.allowsCellularAccess = false  // 仅 Wi-Fi&#10;&#10;let session = URLSession(configuration: config, delegate: self, delegateQueue: nil)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS：大文件同步标记为 discretionary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> URLSessionConfiguration.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">background</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    withIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.app.sync\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config.isDiscretionary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 系统选择最优时机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config.allowsCellularAccess </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 仅 Wi-Fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URLSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">configuration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: config, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delegate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delegateQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"弱网适应\">弱网适应</h2><p>移动网络质量波动大。同步引擎需要根据实时网络质量自适应调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RTT 范围</th>\n<th>网络质量</th>\n<th>同步策略调整</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 100ms</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>正常同步，可发送大 payload</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>适当增大批次减少请求数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>500ms-2s</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n<td>仅同步 CRITICAL/HIGH，启用压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 2s</td>\n<td>极差</td>\n<td>视同离线，仅队列入库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自适应算法——基于滑动窗口的 RTT 估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>smooth</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>smooth</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.125</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTT}_{\\text{smooth}} = \\alpha \\times \\text{RTT}_{\\text{new}} + (1 - \\alpha) \\times \\text{RTT}_{\\text{smooth}} \\quad (\\alpha = 0.125)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smooth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smooth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.125</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>var</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>var</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>RTT</mtext><mtext>smooth</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTT}_{\\text{var}} = (1 - \\beta) \\times \\text{RTT}_{\\text{var}} + \\beta \\times |\\text{RTT}_{\\text{new}} - \\text{RTT}_{\\text{smooth}}| \\quad (\\beta = 0.25)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">var</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">var</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">smooth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这与 TCP 的 RTT 估算算法一致，可用于动态调整同步超时和批次大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据传输量预算\">数据传输量预算</h2><p>为避免同步消耗过多用户流量，设置每日/每月数据预算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SyncBudgetManager(private val prefs: DataStore&lt;Preferences&gt;) {&#10;    companion object {&#10;        const val DAILY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB = 50L&#10;        const val MONTHLY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB = 500L&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun canSync(estimatedBytes: Long, isMetered: Boolean): Boolean {&#10;        if (!isMetered) return true  // Wi-Fi 不限制&#10;&#10;        val todayUsed = getTodayCellularUsage()&#10;        val monthUsed = getMonthCellularUsage()&#10;&#10;        return todayUsed + estimatedBytes &lt; DAILY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB * 1024 * 1024 &amp;&amp;&#10;               monthUsed + estimatedBytes &lt; MONTHLY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB * 1024 * 1024&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun recordUsage(bytes: Long) {&#10;        // 更新今日和本月使用量&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SyncBudgetManager(private val prefs: DataStore&#x3C;Preferences>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    companion object {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const val DAILY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB = 50L</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const val MONTHLY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB = 500L</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun canSync(estimatedBytes: Long, isMetered: Boolean): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!isMetered) return true  // Wi-Fi 不限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val todayUsed = getTodayCellularUsage()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val monthUsed = getMonthCellularUsage()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return todayUsed + estimatedBytes &#x3C; DAILY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB * 1024 * 1024 &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               monthUsed + estimatedBytes &#x3C; MONTHLY_CELLULAR_BUDGET_MB * 1024 * 1024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun recordUsage(bytes: Long) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 更新今日和本月使用量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"同步效率度量\">同步效率度量</h2><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SyncEfficiency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Useful Data Transferred</mtext><mtext>Total Bytes on Wire</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SyncEfficiency} = \\frac{\\text{Useful Data Transferred}}{\\text{Total Bytes on Wire}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SyncEfficiency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Total Bytes on Wire</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Useful Data Transferred</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>影响效率的开销来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTP 头部开销（每请求 200-800 bytes）</li>\n<li>TLS 握手（首次 ~2KB，会话恢复 ~200 bytes）</li>\n<li>同步元数据（cursor、版本号、操作 ID）</li>\n<li>重传/重试</li>\n</ul>\n<p>优化目标是将 SyncEfficiency 维持在 80% 以上。低于此值意味着协议开销过大——可能需要合并小请求、启用 HTTP/2 多路复用、或切换到长连接推送模式。</p>\n<p><a href=\"sync-monitoring-debugging\">同步监控与调试</a> 中的 metrics 体系应包含传输效率指标，以便持续追踪优化效果。同时，<a href=\"../foundations/network-state-detection\">网络状态检测与切换</a> 中的自适应策略为这里的调度决策提供输入信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>带宽与电量优化的核心是减少无线电唤醒次数和每次传输的有效负载比。批量聚合（时间窗口 + 数量阈值）将多次小同步合并为单次大同步，压缩（zstd 可减 70-80% 体积）和 Protocol Buffers 减小传输体积，数据分级 + 条件约束确保非关键数据只在 Wi-Fi+充电时同步，自适应 RTT 估算实现弱网环境下的优雅降级。传输预算管理则从用户角度限制蜂窝数据消耗。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"带宽与电量优化","id":"带宽与电量优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"同步是移动端的隐形资源消费者","id":"同步是移动端的隐形资源消费者"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽优化策略","id":"带宽优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"传输压缩","id":"传输压缩"},{"level":3,"text":"增量同步 vs 全量同步","id":"增量同步-vs-全量同步"},{"level":3,"text":"选择性同步与数据分级","id":"选择性同步与数据分级"},{"level":2,"text":"电量优化策略","id":"电量优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"批量聚合（Batching）","id":"批量聚合-batching"},{"level":3,"text":"智能调度：利用 Piggyback 机会","id":"智能调度-利用-piggyback-机会"},{"level":3,"text":"平台级电量优化 API","id":"平台级电量优化-api"},{"level":2,"text":"弱网适应","id":"弱网适应"},{"level":2,"text":"数据传输量预算","id":"数据传输量预算"},{"level":2,"text":"同步效率度量","id":"同步效率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步监控与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/sync-monitoring-debugging"},"next":{"title":"数据迁移与版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/operations/data-migration-versioning"}}